{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3124","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3124","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3124\",\"parent_revision\":\"5a5a96f9832cab98ccb6c413b23fd1f6e68ef29f2bd629c3ac24703d83c77969\",\"root_revision\":\"5a5a96f9832cab98ccb6c413b23fd1f6e68ef29f2bd629c3ac24703d83c77969\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnterWorktree refuses to run from a subagent that already has a cwd override \u2014 by design, since running it there would mutate the parent session's process-wide cwd. This refusal was confirmed during the #3060 incident investigation and is believed correct.\\n\\nProblem: the expected recovery path when this refusal occurs \u2014 spawning a fresh Agent(isolation=\\\"worktree\\\") instead of trying to self-heal in place \u2014 is not documented anywhere in the development-harness plugin's prose. An agent that hits this refusal has no pointer to the correct recovery and must discover it by trial.\\n\\nObserved: during the #3060 incident investigation session (evidence trail: .tmp/scratch/reports/20260821-task-worker-over-orchestration.md).\\n\\nImpact: agents that hit the EnterWorktree cwd-override refusal waste time rediscovering the correct recovery pattern instead of following a documented pointer.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer reading the documentation**, I want to **enterworktree cwd-override refusal has no documented recovery path** so that **documentation is accurate and trustworthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"64f6b40589220794f416dc00239c052fb7d706dcc247ef9f370ae84c26d3ce67\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABQIqZ-g\"}"}